      "created_at": "2012-05-26T09:48:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had something come up tonight, if you decide to skip your turn that is not the cost of a card, do you skip your entire turn, even your start of turn phase or do you do the start of turn phase first, they skip turn? This is important as we had some cards that we didn’t want to activate at the start of our turns.</p>",
