    {
      "id": 31883,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-26T11:56:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the rule is that, if you skip your play and power phases, you can draw an extra card during your draw phase. There’s no option to skip your turn; although this rule is often over-simplified as skipping your turn, that’s not what’s happening.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:05:50.025Z",
