    {
      "id": 31886,
      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-26T13:46:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m nearly certain the card says something along the lines of “At the start of a player’s turn, that player may skip the rest if ‘his’ turn to destroy this card.”  Thus, it would occur during the normal start of turn phase, processed in card order (so any start of turn effects that was played after this card woulc be skipped if you chose to skip your turn at that time).</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:05:50.166Z",
