    {
      "id": 31887,
      "name": "Koga",
      "username": "Koga",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-26T13:58:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So basically you can’t skip your turn turn unless a card allows you to? That does make sense and pretty much ends any argument about what happens, since when a card allows you to skip your turn you have to do them in order of cards played.</p>",
